# Agent/editor tooling. Streamlit 1.62+ symlinks .agents/ and .claude/ into the project
# on every run, pointing into the local conda env — machine-specific and broken anywhere
# else. .cursor/ is generated by the agent-skills tooling. None of it belongs in a public
# repo. There is no global gitignore on this machine, so it is handled here.
.agents/
.claude/
.cursor/

# macOS
.DS_Store

# Local Streamlit config — machine-specific, and credentials.toml carries an email stamp
.streamlit/
